// Windows resource script for the executable icon. windres compiles this and links the
// result into the exe, which is what Explorer, the taskbar and Qt's default window icon read.
// The path is relative to this file. IDI_ICON1 is the conventional name Qt documents:
// https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/appicon.html
IDI_ICON1 ICON "gangspong.ico"
